# 6. POWERSHELL FILE COMMANDS

PowerShell provides object-based commands called **cmdlets**.

### List files

```powershell
Get-ChildItem
```

### Copy

```powershell
Copy-Item file.txt backup.txt
```

### Move

```powershell
Move-Item file.txt C:\Temp
```

### Rename

```powershell
Rename-Item old.txt new.txt
```

### Delete

```powershell
Remove-Item file.txt
```

### Read file

```powershell
Get-Content file.txt
```

