# 21. FILE SEARCHING

### Linux

```bash
find /home -name "*.txt"
```

Search text:

```bash
grep "error" logfile.txt
```

Combine commands:

```bash
grep "failed" /var/log/*.log
```

---

### Windows CMD

```cmd
dir /s *.txt
```

Search text:

```cmd
findstr /s /i "error" *.log
```

---

### PowerShell

```powershell
Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter *.txt
```

Search inside files:

```powershell
Select-String -Path *.log -Pattern "error"
```

