| Create directory | `mkdir` | `mkdir` | `New-Item -Type Directory` |
| Copy | `cp` | `copy` | `Copy-Item` |
| Move | `mv` | `move` | `Move-Item` |
| Delete | `rm` | `del` | `Remove-Item` |
| Read file | `cat` | `type` | `Get-Content` |
| Current user | `whoami` | `whoami` | `whoami` |
| Processes | `ps` | `tasklist` | `Get-Process` |
| Network config | `ip addr` | `ipconfig` | `Get-NetIPConfiguration` |
| Network connections | `ss` | `netstat` | `Get-NetTCPConnection` |
| DNS query | `dig` | `nslookup` | `Resolve-DnsName` |
| Services | `systemctl` | `sc` | `Get-Service` |
| Logs | `journalctl` | Event Viewer | `Get-WinEvent` |

